      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ mëë /ka̱nkɔ jɛ luäŋ kɛ ruɔ̱t, cuakɔ jɛ nhɔk ɛn ɣöö bakɔ duɔth kärɔ̱ kä A-thɛn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cuakɔ Ti-mo-thi min la dämandan kä läät Kuɔth kɛɛl kɛ kɔ rɛy thukni Kritho tin gɔw ja̱k. Kä jäk nɛy ɛ kɛ ɣöö bɛ yɛ wä bum kä bɛ yɛ com rɛy ŋäthädun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö bɛ thil ram mi loc jɔk kɛ kui̱ rikni ti̱ti̱. Ŋäc yɛn ɛ pua̱nykun ɛn ɣöö banɛ kɛn rik ti̱ti̱ dhil jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ thuɔ̱k mëë ta̱kɔ kɛɛl kɛ yɛ, cuakɔ jɛ la̱r yɛ nikɛ nhiam ɛn ɣöö bakɔ riɛk rut, kä cuɛ ben tuɔɔk ala jɛn, ce̱tkɛ min ŋäc yɛn ɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ luɔt ɛmɛ, mëë /ka̱n jɛ luäŋ kɛ ruɔ̱t, cua̱ raan ja̱k, kɛ ɣöö bä ŋa̱thdun ŋa̱c. Kä ɣän dualä ɛn ɣöö dɔ̱ŋ ci gua̱n mɛɛtdä yɛ ɣɔam, a dee la̱tda cua̱ ni baŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ ci Ti-mo-thi luny jɔk, kä cɛ kɔ nöŋ thuk ti gɔw kɛ kui̱ ŋäthädun kɛnɛ nhökdun. Kä cɛ la̱r kɔ bä ɛn ɣöö la yɛn kɔ a tiim ni ciaŋ agɔaa, kä go̱o̱r yɛn ɣöö dërɛ kɔ nɛn ce̱tkɛ min görkɔ nëndun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, dämaari, cuakɔ buɔ̱m kɛ yɛ kɛ kui̱ ŋäthädun rɛy bɛ̈c bɛ̈ɛ̈cnikɔ kɛnɛ rikɔ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ, cakɔ tëk, mi cuŋ yɛn a bum rɛy Kua̱r ni Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac mi te di mi dëëkɔ la̱r Kuoth kɛ kui̱dun mi ro̱ŋ mi dëëkɔ luɔ̱c yɛ kɛ kui̱ tɛthä lɔaac min cakɔ jek nhiam Kuɔthdan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Palkɔ Kuoth kɛ wäär kɛnɛ cäŋ kɛ lɔcdä kɛɛliw, kɛ ɣöö dɔ̱ŋ dëëkɔ yɛ nɛn a guɛcnɛ rɔ̱, kä dëëkɔ yɛ luɔ̱c min te jɔ̱ɔ̱r rɛy ŋäthädun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ, a Kuothdan in la Gua̱ndan puɔ̱nydɛ kɛnɛ Kuääran ni Yecu rial duɔ̱ɔ̱pdä ikä kɛ ɣöö bakɔ ben kä yɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä a Kuäär jak yɛ kä bia rɔ̱ rep a bia thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ nhökdun kɛ rɔ̱ kamnikun kɛnɛ nɛy diaal, ce̱tnikɛ min nhɔk nɛy yɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä derɛ lo̱ckun jakä bum a bi yɛn a nɛy ti rɛl rɔ ti thil bɛ̈ɛ̈l nhiam Kuɔthdan in la Gua̱ndan, kɛ gua̱a̱th benä Kua̱ran ni Yecu kɛɛl kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal tin ci Kuoth kɛ lɛy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
